---
const cbamPrice = 75.28;
const cbamPeriod = "2026 Q2";
const cbamPublished = "6 Temmuz 2026";
const cbamNext = "5 Ekim 2026";
---

<section class="market-terminal" id="canli-karbon-fiyatlari">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="terminal-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">CARBON MARKET TERMINAL</span>
        <h2>Karbon fiyatını izlemeyin. Finansal etkisini yönetin.</h2>
        <p>
          Resmî CBAM fiyatı, EUA piyasa görünümü ve Türkiye ETS statüsü tek ekranda.
          Ardından bu fiyatı şirketinizin tonajına, emisyon yoğunluğuna ve satış büyüklüğüne çevirin.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-status">
        <span class="pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div>
          <strong>PİYASA VERİ PANELİ</strong>
          <small>CBAM referansı: 2026 Q2 · EUA: EEX canlı veri mimarisi</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="market-strip">
      <article class="market-card official-card">
        <div class="market-card-top">
          <div>
            <span class="market-code">CBAM</span>
            <span class="status-pill official">RESMÎ</span>
          </div>
          <span class="market-type">AB sertifika fiyatı</span>
        </div>
        <div class="market-value">
          <strong>€{cbamPrice.toFixed(2).replace(".", ",")}</strong>
          <span>/ tCO₂</span>
        </div>
        <div class="market-meta">
          <div><span>Dönem</span><strong>{cbamPeriod}</strong></div>
          <div><span>Yayın</span><strong>{cbamPublished}</strong></div>
          <div><span>Sonraki</span><strong>{cbamNext}</strong></div>
        </div>
        <p>
          Avrupa Komisyonu tarafından yayımlanan 2026 Q2 resmî CBAM sertifika fiyatı.
        </p>
        <a
          class="source-link"
          href="https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/price-cbam-certificates_en"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          Avrupa Komisyonu kaynağı ↗
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="market-card live-card">
        <div class="market-card-top">
          <div>
            <span class="market-code">EU ETS · EUA</span>
            <span class="status-pill market">CANLI</span>
          </div>
          <span class="market-type">Canlı EU carbon allowance görünümü</span>
        </div>

        <div class="eua-live-terminal" data-eua-live>
          <div class="eua-live-head">
            <div>
              <span class="feed-kicker">EEX GROUP DATASOURCE · REST API V2</span>
              <div class="feed-state" data-eua-state="connecting">
                <span class="feed-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <strong data-eua-state-label>BAĞLANIYOR</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="feed-age" data-eua-age>—</span>
          </div>

          <div class="eua-price-row">
            <div>
              <span class="quote-label">EUA</span>
              <strong class="eua-price" data-eua-price>—</strong>
              <span class="quote-unit">EUR / tCO₂</span>
            </div>
            <div class="eua-change" data-eua-change-state="flat">
              <span data-eua-change>—</span>
              <small>oturum içi</small>
            </div>
          </div>

          <svg class="eua-sparkline" viewBox="0 0 420 86" role="img" aria-label="Son EUA fiyat hareketi">
            <polyline data-eua-line points="" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></polyline>
          </svg>

          <div class="quote-grid">
            <div><span>BID</span><strong data-eua-bid>—</strong></div>
            <div><span>ASK</span><strong data-eua-ask>—</strong></div>
            <div><span>SPREAD</span><strong data-eua-spread>—</strong></div>
            <div><span>LATENCY</span><strong data-eua-latency>—</strong></div>
          </div>

          <div class="feed-meta">
            <div><span>Instrument</span><strong data-eua-instrument>—</strong></div>
            <div><span>Piyasa zamanı</span><strong data-eua-market-time>—</strong></div>
            <div><span>Son alım</span><strong data-eua-received-time>—</strong></div>
            <div><span>Fiyat tipi</span><strong data-eua-price-type>—</strong></div>
          </div>

          <div class="feed-warning" data-eua-warning hidden></div>
        </div>

        <div class="data-note">
          <span class="data-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p>
            Bu panel EEX Group DataSource REST API v2 üzerinden doğrudan piyasa kaynağına bağlanacak şekilde
            tasarlanmıştır. Arayüz 5 saniyede bir aynı-origin backend endpointini kontrol eder; veri yaşı ölçülür,
            eski veri <strong>STALE</strong> olarak işaretlenir ve son doğrulanmış kotasyon ile yeni veri birbirine karıştırılmaz.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          class="source-link market-source"
          href="https://www.eex.com/en/market-data/eex-group-datasource/real-time-data"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          EEX Group DataSource kaynağı ↗
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="market-card tr-card">
        <div class="market-card-top">
          <div>
            <span class="market-code">TÜRKİYE ETS</span>
            <span class="status-pill pilot">PİLOT</span>
          </div>
          <span class="market-type">Ulusal karbon piyasası</span>
        </div>
        <div class="empty-price">
          <strong>Henüz fiyat oluşmadı</strong>
          <span>Resmî piyasa fiyatı yayınlanmadı</span>
        </div>
        <div class="market-meta">
          <div><span>Durum</span><strong>Pilot / hazırlık</strong></div>
          <div><span>Modelleme</span><strong>Senaryo ile</strong></div>
          <div><span>Kaynak</span><strong>Resmî gelişmeler</strong></div>
        </div>
        <p>
          Piyasa fiyatı oluşana kadar burada tahmin “canlı fiyat” olarak gösterilmez.
          Finansal modelleme yalnızca açıkça etiketlenmiş senaryo fiyatlarıyla yapılır.
        </p>
        <a class="source-link" href="/turkiye-ets">Türkiye ETS görünümü →</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="impact-engine">
      <div class="engine-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">FİYAT → MALİYET → MARJ</span>
        <h3>Karbon fiyatını şirketinize çevirin.</h3>
        <p>
          Bu motor piyasa yorumlamaz; deterministik hesap yapar. İhracat tonajı, gömülü emisyon yoğunluğu
          ve satış büyüklüğünüz üzerinden karbon maliyetinin finansal baskısını saniyeler içinde gösterir.
        </p>

        <div class="method-tags">
          <span>AI’sız hesaplama</span>
          <span>Formül görünür</span>
          <span>Kaynak ayrıştırılmış</span>
          <span>Senaryo kontrollü</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="engine-panel" data-carbon-engine data-cbam-price={cbamPrice}>
        <div class="input-grid">
          <label for="carbon-export-tonnes">
            <span>Yıllık AB ihracatı</span>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input id="carbon-export-tonnes" type="number" min="0" step="100" value="1000" data-export-tonnes />
              <em>ton</em>
            </div>
          </label>

          <label for="carbon-intensity">
            <span>Gömülü emisyon yoğunluğu</span>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input id="carbon-intensity" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="1.80" data-intensity />
              <em>tCO₂ / ton</em>
            </div>
          </label>

          <label for="carbon-sales">
            <span>Yıllık AB satış tutarı</span>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input id="carbon-sales" type="number" min="0" step="10000" value="2500000" data-sales />
              <em>€</em>
            </div>
          </label>

          <label for="carbon-price">
            <span>Karbon fiyatı</span>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input id="carbon-price" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value={cbamPrice} data-carbon-price />
              <em>€/tCO₂</em>
            </div>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="preset-row">
          <button type="button" class="preset active" data-price-preset={cbamPrice}>CBAM {cbamPeriod}</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset" data-price-preset="90">€90 senaryo</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset" data-price-preset="110">€110 stres</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset" data-price-preset="150">€150 yüksek stres</button>
        </div>

        <div class="results-grid">
          <div class="result primary">
            <span>Toplam gömülü emisyon</span>
            <strong data-result-emissions>1.800 tCO₂</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="result">
            <span>Yıllık karbon maliyeti</span>
            <strong data-result-cost>€135.504</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="result">
            <span>İhraç tonuna maliyet</span>
            <strong data-result-per-ton>€135,50</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="result danger">
            <span>Satış gelirine baskı</span>
            <strong data-result-sales-impact>%5,42</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="formula">
          <span>FORMÜL</span>
          <code>İhracat tonajı × tCO₂/ton × karbon fiyatı = yıllık karbon maliyeti</code>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="intelligence-grid">
      <article>
        <span class="intel-no">01</span>
        <h4>Resmî fiyatı piyasa fiyatından ayırıyoruz.</h4>
        <p>
          CBAM sertifika fiyatı ile EUA vadeli piyasa kotasyonu aynı şey değildir.
          Sistem bunları tek rakam gibi sunmaz.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="intel-no">02</span>
        <h4>Fiyat değişimini işletme kararına bağlıyoruz.</h4>
        <p>
          “Karbon €85 oldu” bilgisini; maliyet, marj, satış fiyatı ve müşteri kârlılığına çevirmek asıl üründür.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="intel-no">03</span>
        <h4>Olmayan veriyi üretmiyoruz.</h4>
        <p>
          Türkiye ETS gibi resmî fiyatı oluşmamış piyasalarda tahmini rakamı canlı fiyat gibi göstermiyoruz.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="intel-no">04</span>
        <h4>Her veriye kaynak ve statü ekliyoruz.</h4>
        <p>
          Resmî, piyasa, pilot ve senaryo fiyatları görsel olarak ayrılır; karar katmanı hangi veriyi kullandığını bilir.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { computeExposureCore } from "../lib/financial-core.mjs";

  const liveRoot = document.querySelector("[data-eua-live]");

  if (liveRoot) {
    const endpoint = "/api/eua-market";
    const pollMs = 5000;
    const staleMs = 30000;
    const points = [];
    let firstPrice = null;
    let lastQuote = null;
    let timer = null;
    let ageTimer = null;

    const priceEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-price]");
    const bidEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-bid]");
    const askEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-ask]");
    const spreadEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-spread]");
    const latencyEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-latency]");
    const instrumentEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-instrument]");
    const marketTimeEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-market-time]");
    const receivedTimeEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-received-time]");
    const priceTypeEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-price-type]");
    const ageEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-age]");
    const stateLabel = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-state-label]");
    const changeEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-change]");
    const changeWrap = liveRoot.querySelector(".eua-change");
    const lineEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-line]");
    const warningEl = liveRoot.querySelector("[data-eua-warning]");

    const fmt = new Intl.NumberFormat("tr-TR", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });
    const pct = new Intl.NumberFormat("tr-TR", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });

    const setState = (state, label) => {
      liveRoot.dataset.euaState = state;
      if (stateLabel) stateLabel.textContent = label;
    };

    const renderSparkline = () => {
      if (!lineEl || points.length < 2) {
        if (lineEl) lineEl.setAttribute("points", "");
        return;
      }
      const values = points.map((p) => p.price);
      const min = Math.min(...values);
      const max = Math.max(...values);
      const span = Math.max(0.01, max - min);
      const width = 420;
      const height = 86;
      const pad = 5;
      const coords = points.map((p, index) => {
        const x = pad + (index / Math.max(1, points.length - 1)) * (width - pad * 2);
        const y = height - pad - ((p.price - min) / span) * (height - pad * 2);
        return x.toFixed(1) + "," + y.toFixed(1);
      }).join(" ");
      lineEl.setAttribute("points", coords);
    };

    const renderAge = () => {
      if (!lastQuote?.marketTimestamp && !lastQuote?.receivedAt) {
        if (ageEl) ageEl.textContent = "Veri zamanı bekleniyor";
        return;
      }
      const sourceTime = new Date(lastQuote.marketTimestamp || lastQuote.receivedAt).getTime();
      const ageMs = Math.max(0, Date.now() - sourceTime);
      const seconds = Math.round(ageMs / 1000);
      if (ageEl) ageEl.textContent = seconds < 60 ? seconds + " sn önce" : Math.floor(seconds / 60) + " dk önce";

      if (ageMs > staleMs) {
        setState("stale", "STALE");
      } else if (lastQuote?.freshness === "stale-fallback") {
        setState("stale", "YEDEK / ESKİ");
      } else {
        setState("live", "CANLI");
      }
    };

    const renderQuote = (quote) => {
      lastQuote = quote;
      if (firstPrice === null) firstPrice = quote.price;

      if (priceEl) priceEl.textContent = "€" + fmt.format(quote.price);
      if (bidEl) bidEl.textContent = Number.isFinite(quote.bid) ? "€" + fmt.format(quote.bid) : "—";
      if (askEl) askEl.textContent = Number.isFinite(quote.ask) ? "€" + fmt.format(quote.ask) : "—";
      if (spreadEl) spreadEl.textContent = Number.isFinite(quote.spread) ? "€" + fmt.format(quote.spread) : "—";
      if (latencyEl) latencyEl.textContent = Number.isFinite(quote.upstreamLatencyMs) ? quote.upstreamLatencyMs + " ms" : "—";
      if (instrumentEl) instrumentEl.textContent = quote.instrument || "EUA";
      if (marketTimeEl) marketTimeEl.textContent = quote.marketTimestamp ? new Date(quote.marketTimestamp).toLocaleTimeString("tr-TR") : "—";
      if (receivedTimeEl) receivedTimeEl.textContent = quote.receivedAt ? new Date(quote.receivedAt).toLocaleTimeString("tr-TR") : "—";
      if (priceTypeEl) priceTypeEl.textContent = quote.priceType === "mid" ? "Bid/Ask Mid" : quote.priceType === "last" ? "Son İşlem" : String(quote.priceType || "—");

      const change = firstPrice > 0 ? ((quote.price - firstPrice) / firstPrice) * 100 : 0;
      if (changeEl) changeEl.textContent = (change > 0 ? "+" : "") + pct.format(change) + "%";
      if (changeWrap) changeWrap.dataset.euaChangeState = change > 0 ? "up" : change < 0 ? "down" : "flat";

      points.push({ price: quote.price, at: Date.now() });
      if (points.length > 60) points.shift();
      renderSparkline();

      if (warningEl) {
        if (quote.warning) {
          warningEl.hidden = false;
          warningEl.textContent = "Kaynak uyarısı: " + quote.warning;
        } else {
          warningEl.hidden = true;
          warningEl.textContent = "";
        }
      }

      renderAge();
    };

    const poll = async () => {
      const controller = new AbortController();
      const timeout = window.setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), 4500);
      try {
        const response = await fetch(endpoint, {
          method: "GET",
          headers: { "Accept": "application/json" },
          cache: "no-store",
          signal: controller.signal
        });
        const payload = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));

        if (!response.ok || !payload.ok || !Number.isFinite(payload.price)) {
          throw new Error(payload.message || payload.detail || payload.error || "Canlı EUA verisi alınamadı");
        }

        renderQuote(payload);
      } catch (error) {
        if (!lastQuote) setState("offline", "VERİ YOK");
        else setState("stale", "BAĞLANTI KESİLDİ");
        if (warningEl) {
          warningEl.hidden = false;
          warningEl.textContent = "Canlı kaynak bağlantısı: " + (error?.message || "erişilemiyor");
        }
      } finally {
        window.clearTimeout(timeout);
        timer = window.setTimeout(poll, pollMs);
      }
    };

    setState("connecting", "BAĞLANIYOR");
    poll();
    ageTimer = window.setInterval(renderAge, 1000);

    window.addEventListener("pagehide", () => {
      if (timer) window.clearTimeout(timer);
      if (ageTimer) window.clearInterval(ageTimer);
    }, { once: true });
  }

  const root = document.querySelector("[data-carbon-engine]");

  if (root) {
    const exportInput = root.querySelector("[data-export-tonnes]");
    const intensityInput = root.querySelector("[data-intensity]");
    const salesInput = root.querySelector("[data-sales]");
    const priceInput = root.querySelector("[data-carbon-price]");

    const emissionsOut = root.querySelector("[data-result-emissions]");
    const costOut = root.querySelector("[data-result-cost]");
    const perTonOut = root.querySelector("[data-result-per-ton]");
    const impactOut = root.querySelector("[data-result-sales-impact]");

    const euro0 = new Intl.NumberFormat("tr-TR", { style: "currency", currency: "EUR", maximumFractionDigits: 0 });
    const euro2 = new Intl.NumberFormat("tr-TR", { style: "currency", currency: "EUR", minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });
    const num0 = new Intl.NumberFormat("tr-TR", { maximumFractionDigits: 0 });
    const pct2 = new Intl.NumberFormat("tr-TR", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });

    const raw = (el) => Number.parseFloat(el?.value ?? "");

    const calculate = () => {
      try {
        const result = computeExposureCore({
          tonnes: raw(exportInput),
          intensity: raw(intensityInput),
          annualSales: raw(salesInput),
          carbonPrice: raw(priceInput)
        });

        if (emissionsOut) emissionsOut.textContent = num0.format(result.emissions) + " tCO₂";
        if (costOut) costOut.textContent = euro0.format(result.carbonCost);
        if (perTonOut) perTonOut.textContent = euro2.format(result.carbonCostPerTon);
        if (impactOut) impactOut.textContent = "%" + pct2.format(result.salesImpactPct);
        root.dataset.engineState = "valid";
        return result;
      } catch {
        root.dataset.engineState = "invalid";
        if (emissionsOut) emissionsOut.textContent = "—";
        if (costOut) costOut.textContent = "—";
        if (perTonOut) perTonOut.textContent = "—";
        if (impactOut) impactOut.textContent = "—";
        return null;
      }
    };

    [exportInput, intensityInput, salesInput, priceInput].forEach((input) => {
      input?.addEventListener("input", () => {
        root.querySelectorAll("[data-price-preset]").forEach((button) => button.classList.remove("active"));
        calculate();
      });
    });

    root.querySelectorAll("[data-price-preset]").forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const preset = Number.parseFloat(button.dataset.pricePreset || "");
        if (priceInput && Number.isFinite(preset)) priceInput.value = String(preset);
        root.querySelectorAll("[data-price-preset]").forEach((item) => item.classList.remove("active"));
        button.classList.add("active");
        calculate();
      });
    });

    calculate();
  }
</script>

<style>
  .market-terminal {
    padding: 92px 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 82% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,.025), transparent 24%),
      #070909;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  .terminal-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .terminal-head > div:first-child { max-width: 840px; }

  .terminal-head h2 {
    margin: 14px 0 14px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 62px);
    line-height: .98;
    letter-spacing: -.045em;
  }

  .terminal-head p {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .terminal-status {
    min-width: 210px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
    padding: 13px 15px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.018);
  }

  .terminal-status .pulse {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }

  .terminal-status strong,
  .terminal-status small { display: block; }

  .terminal-status strong {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }

  .terminal-status small {
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .market-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.35fr .9fr;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .market-card {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.025), transparent 30%),
      #111414;
  }

  .live-card {
    padding: 22px 18px 18px;
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.26);
  }

  .market-card-top {
    min-height: 34px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .market-card-top > div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .market-code {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .09em;
  }

  .market-type {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .status-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 22px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 800;
